sequenceDiagram
  participant H as Harness / Serial
  participant S as EnclaveSlot
  participant V as SoftISA body
  participant C as BlastChamber

  H->>S: enclave_load(BIL1)
  S-->>H: EnclaveId
  H->>S: enclave_run
  S->>V: step/run (Vm or bil_isa.c)
  V-->>S: EnclaveResult
  S-->>H: result
  H->>S: enclave_dispose
  Note over S: zeroize RAM + out
  H->>C: chamber_ratify(result, RatifySpec)
  alt predicates hold
    C-->>H: RATIFIED + artifact_digest
  else fail
    C-->>H: Reject
  end
